    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 10 The Meadows, Classes Lake, Ovens is presented in exceptional show-house condition throughout having recently undergone a comprehensive renovation to the highest of standards.\r\nIdeally located close to a wide range of amenities, this impressive property combines stylish contemporary finishes with generous, well-proportioned accommodation. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with cloak room, spacious living room, large open-plan kitchen/dining room, bright sunroom, utility room, family room, home office and guest WC.\r\nUpstairs, there are four generously sized bedrooms, two of which benefit from stylish en-suite bathrooms, together with a beautifully appointed family bathroom.\r\nThe property has been finished to an excellent standard, with standout features including elegant panelled walls, glass balustrades to the staircase and high-quality quartz countertops in both the kitchen and utility room. The kitchen and bathrooms have all been newly fitted, creating a fresh, modern and sophisticated interior throughout.\r\nExternally, the property benefits from ample off-street parking to the front and a large, private rear garden, providing excellent outdoor space for family living and entertaining.\r\nWith an impressive B BER rating, this beautifully renovated home offers exceptional energy efficiency alongside superb presentation and modern comfort."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance / Hallway\r\nContemporary avant-garde door with glass panel inset leading to hallway with laminate floor, radiator, centre light and cloakroom. \r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.57m × 3.91m)\r\nLaminate floor covering, bespoke media wall with inset electric fire with feature shelving and recessed lighting, bay style window facing front of property with window blind, coving, radiator and centre light. \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room (7.92 m × 3.15 m) \r\nLaminate floor throughout.\r\n\r\nKitchen Area\r\nRecently fitted shaker style kitchen units at floor and eye level, island unit, quartz worktops and splash back, stainless steel electric oven with ceramic hob and extractor over, dual aspect windows facing side and rear of property with window blinds, integrated dishwasher and fridge freezer. \r\n\r\nDining Area\r\nRadiator, centre light and panelled walls.\r\n\r\nSunroom (3.43 m × 3.12 m)\r\nLaminate wood floor, vaulted ceiling, door exiting to garden at rear.  \r\n\r\nUtility (2.97 m × 2.18 m) \r\nLaminate wood floor, plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer, built-in storage units, WHB with quartz countertop and splash back, centre light and door exiting to gardens at rear.\r\n\r\nOffice (2.79 m × 1.60 m)\r\nLaminate floor, radiator, centre light and window with window blind facing front of property. \r\n\r\nGuest WC \r\nWC, WHB, floor tiles, recessed lighting and xpelair. \r\n\r\nStairs / Landing\r\nCarpet floor covering on stairs and landing, paneled walls and feature glass balustrade on stairs, Stira stairs to floored attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.96 m × 4.22 m) \r\nLaminate floor, wall to wall fitted wardrobes, radiator, centre light, window with window blind facing front of property.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (1.85 m × 2.18 m) \r\nWC, WHB with LED mirror over, corner electric shower, towel rail, centre light, window with blind facing front of property. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.66 m × 2.72 m) \r\nLaminate wood floor, built in slide robes, radiator, centre light, window with window blind facing front of property. \r\n\r\nEn-suite (1.73 m × 1.65 m) \r\nWC, WHB, corner electric shower, chrome towel rail and centre light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3.58 m × 2.79 m)\r\nLaminate wood floor, built in slide robes, radiator, centre light, window with window blind facing rear of property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (2.82 m × 2.34 m)\r\nLaminate wood floor, built in slide robes, radiator, centre light and window with window blind facing rear of property.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.29 m × 1.98 m)\r\nWC, WHB with LED mirror over, standalone bath, recessed lighting, fully tiled walls and floor, towel rail, window with window blind facing rear of property. \r\n\r\nFamily Room (3.71 m × 2.95 m) \r\nLaminate wood floor, radiator, centre light, window with window blind facing front of property.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nTo the front - Off-street parking with gardens laid to lawn incorporating mature shrubbery borders, side gate access to rear. \r\nTo the rear - large gardens to rear incorporating patio area, gardens laid to lawn with mature shrubbery and planting, outside tap, power points, light and garden shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 bedroom detached in show house condition.\r\nRecently renovated throughout to the highest of standards.\r\nSolar panels including 5kW battery and EV charger fitted resulting in B1 energy rating.\r\n2 en-suite bedrooms.\r\nQuartz counter tops in kitchen and utility.\r\nLarge private rear gardens with garden shed."
      },
